## 📂 Essential SecLists Paths for API Fuzzing
When configuring your ffuf paths, skip generic wordlists and target these specific directories inside [SecLists](https://github.com/danielmiessler/SecLists):

* 
* API Endpoints: /Discovery/Web-Content/api/ (Contains dedicated files for Swagger, OpenAPI, and common microservice paths).
* Parameter Names: /Discovery/Web-Content/burp-parameter-names.txt (An exceptional list for uncovering hidden API query parameters).
* HTTP Verbs: /Discovery/Web-Content/web-vulnerabilities.txt (Contains method variations like GET, POST, PUT, DELETE, PATCH, OPTIONS, HEAD).
* 

